{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1771967227\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mind Apart is a story-driven adventure RPG shaped by your choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a girl, lost within a fragmented world\u2014a reality that mirrors her inner struggles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to piece together the memories that reveal who you are and where you belong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which paths to follow and which bonds to form, shaping her identity and fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/878ce740c158c24a69185a34ceb01f08.apng?t=1771967227\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/878ce740c158c24a69185a34ceb01f08.poster.avif?t=1771967227\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-driven storytelling</strong> with optional bonds that reflect your internal conflicts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching narrative</strong> where your choices shape both the story and what you come to understand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A non-combat adventure</strong> centered on environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm yet haunting artwork paired with an atmospheric original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple outcomes and hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1771967227\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713290?t=1771967227","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713290?t=1771967227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/1b1921b0ca57ac4d844609268aada1ff9e9721ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771967227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/1b1921b0ca57ac4d844609268aada1ff9e9721ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771967227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores emotionally heavy themes that may be sensitive for some players. It includes narrative elements related to trauma, psychological distress, and challenging life experiences. While there is no graphic violence or explicit content, certain scenes may evoke strong emotional responses. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1771967227\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mind Apart is a story-driven adventure RPG shaped by your choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a girl, lost within a fragmented world\u2014a reality that mirrors her inner struggles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to piece together the memories that reveal who you are and where you belong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which paths to follow and which bonds to form, shaping her identity and fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/878ce740c158c24a69185a34ceb01f08.apng?t=1771967227\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/878ce740c158c24a69185a34ceb01f08.poster.avif?t=1771967227\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-driven storytelling</strong> with optional bonds that reflect your internal conflicts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching narrative</strong> where your choices shape both the story and what you come to understand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A non-combat adventure</strong> centered on environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm yet haunting artwork paired with an atmospheric original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple outcomes and hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1771967227\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tiny Purple Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/